## Deduplication (keep one row per group)

::code-wrapper{language="sql"}
```sql
-- Keep the most recent row per user, delete the rest
DELETE FROM events
WHERE id IN (
  SELECT id FROM (
    SELECT id, ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY created_at DESC) AS rn
    FROM events
  ) t WHERE rn > 1
);
``
